<title>GERMANY: Boss shares suspended due to pending news.</title>
<headline>Boss shares suspended due to pending news.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German bourse said on Thursday that trading in men's fashion retailer Hugo Boss AG has been suspended ahead of an important news announcement.</p>
<p>The suspension applies to both Boss' preference and ordinary shares.</p>
<p>Boss' preference shares closed trading on Wednesday at 1,950 marks and the ordinary shares at 1,880 marks. Neither of the shares had so far traded on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
